•changes to U.S. participation in, withdrawal from, or renegotiation of certain international trade agreements or other major trade-related issues, including the non-renewal of expiring favorable tariffs granted to developing countries, tariff quotas and retaliatory tariffs, trade sanctions, new or onerous trade restrictions, embargoes and other stringent government controls;

